const navIcons:Record<Nav,IconType>={'Overview':LayoutDashboard,'Academic Mapping':BookOpen,'Materials':FolderOpen,'Live Sessions':CalendarDays,'Notifications':Bell,'Students':Users,'Faculty':GraduationCap,'Analytics':ChartNoAxesCombined,'My Learning':BookOpen,'My Sessions':CalendarDays,'Settings':Settings2};
const courseName=(id:string)=>courses.find(x=>x.id===id)?.name||id;const planName=(id:string)=>plans.find(x=>x.id===id)?.name||id;const subName=(id:string)=>subjects.find(x=>x.id===id)?.name||id;const stamp=()=>new Date().toLocaleString('en-IN');const id=()=>Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,10);
